# Student Performance Prediction using Machine Learning

## 📌 Project Overview
This project predicts student performance using Machine Learning.

The model uses student-related features such as assignments, sleep hours, study hours, attendance, and previous marks to predict student performance.

## 🎯 Objective
The main objective of this project is to use Machine Learning to predict the expected performance of a student based on different academic and lifestyle factors.

## 📊 Features Used
- Assignments
- Sleep Hours
- Study Hours
- Attendance
- Previous Marks

## 🤖 Machine Learning Algorithm
- Linear Regression

## 🛠️ Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Scikit-learn
- Google Colab

## 📈 Model Evaluation
The model was evaluated using Mean Squared Error (MSE).

## 🔮 Prediction
The trained model can predict the expected performance of a new student using the selected features.

## 📁 Project File
The complete Python/Google Colab notebook is available in this repository.

